                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 7, 1894.—Read,
                    referred to the Committee on Foreign Relations, and ordered to be printed.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Congress</hi>:</p>
                <p>I transmit herewith copies of certain dispatches lately received from our
                    minister at Hawaii, together with copies of the inclosures which accompanied
                    such dispatches.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grover Cleveland.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Executive
                            Mansion</hi>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian" when="1894-03-07"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">March 7, 1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>









